// Linux native backend: FFI is not dynamically linked yet.
//
// Current rolling contract:
// - `ffi name` is accepted by the compiler so the syntax surface stays stable.
// - On Linux native backends (arm64-linux + x64-linux), unresolved imports are stubbed
//   and will panic when called (until DT_NEEDED/PLT/GOT is implemented).
//
// This test is executed only on Linux targets via `scripts/verify_native_matrix.sh`.

ffi puts
puts("Hello FFI (should panic on Linux native)")
exit(0)

